{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"agent_message","text":"我在枚举小尺寸合法掩码，看这个机制下“双方都 4 连通且 bbox 都是满尺寸”的形状分布。这个能直接指导生成器选什么尺寸，避免靠猜。"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python - <<'PY'\nfrom itertools import product\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef conn(bits,h,w,val):\n    pts=[i for i,b in enumerate(bits) if b==val]\n    if not pts: return False\n    start=pts[0]\n    q=deque([start]); seen={start}\n    while q:\n        i=q.popleft(); r=i//w; c=i%w\n        for dr,dc in ((1,0),(-1,0),(0,1),(0,-1)):\n            rr,cc=r+dr,c+dc\n            j=rr*w+cc\n            if 0<=rr<h and 0<=cc<w and bits[j]==val and j not in seen:\n                seen.add(j); q.append(j)\n    return len(seen)==len(pts)\n\ndef bbox_full(bits,h,w,val):\n    pts=[i for i,b in enumerate(bits) if b==val]\n    if not pts: return False\n    rs=[i//w for i in pts]; cs=[i%w for i in pts]\n    return min(rs)==0 and max(rs)==h-1 and min(cs)==0 and max(cs)==w-1\n\nfor h,w in [(3,3),(3,4),(4,4),(4,5)]:\n    n=0\n    ex=[]\n    for bits in product([0,1], repeat=h*w):\n        if all(bits) or not any(bits):\n            continue\n        if conn(bits,h,w,1) and conn(bits,h,w,0) and bbox_full(bits,h,w,1) and bbox_full(bits,h,w,0):\n            n+=1\n            if len(ex)<5:\n                ex.append(bits)\n    print((h,w), n)\n    for bits in ex[:2]:\n        for r in range(h):\n            print(''.join('#' if bits[r*w+c] else '.' for c in range(w)))\n            \n        print()\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
