{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"agent_message","text":"这里有个需要明确的技术问题：按题面原文，“两块都是 4 连通，且各自最小 bbox 尺寸相同，并且二者在该 bbox 内互补成满矩形”在拓扑上不可实现。因为任一 4 连通块只要同时触到 bbox 的左右边，就包含一条左到右路径，这会把另一块的 4 连通上到下通路切断。\n\n为了把题意里真正想考的“bbox 内形状互补 + 面积排序”机制落成可运行题，我会做最小一致性修正：把组件识别和生成都改成 `8-connected`，其余配对、排序、输出规则保持不变。这是目前唯一能自洽实现并通过自检的版本。"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python - <<'PY'\nimport random\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef conn(mask, val=True, conn8=False):\n    h=len(mask); w=len(mask[0])\n    pts=[(r,c) for r in range(h) for c in range(w) if mask[r][c]==val]\n    if not pts: return False\n    dirs=[(1,0),(-1,0),(0,1),(0,-1)]\n    if conn8: dirs += [(1,1),(1,-1),(-1,1),(-1,-1)]\n    q=deque([pts[0]]); seen={pts[0]}\n    while q:\n        r,c=q.popleft()\n        for dr,dc in dirs:\n            rr,cc=r+dr,c+dc\n            if 0<=rr<h and 0<=cc<w and mask[rr][cc]==val and (rr,cc) not in seen:\n                seen.add((rr,cc)); q.append((rr,cc))\n    return len(seen)==len(pts)\n\ndef bbox_full(mask,val=True):\n    pts=[(r,c) for r,row in enumerate(mask) for c,x in enumerate(row) if x==val]\n    rs=[r for r,c in pts]; cs=[c for r,c in pts]\n    h=len(mask); w=len(mask[0])\n    return min(rs)==0 and max(rs)==h-1 and min(cs)==0 and max(cs)==w-1\n\ndef gen(h,w):\n    while True:\n        seq=['R']*(w-1)+['D']*(h-1)\n        random.shuffle(seq)\n        if 'D' not in seq[:w-1] and w>1:\n            continue\n        if 'R' not in seq[:h-1] and h>1:\n            continue\n        if seq[0]==seq[-1]:\n            pass\n        r=c=0\n        cells={(r,c)}\n        for s in seq:\n            if s=='R': c+=1\n            else: r+=1\n            cells.add((r,c))\n        mask=[[False]*w for _ in range(h)]\n        for r,c in cells: mask[r][c]=True\n        comp=[[not x for x in row] for row in mask]\n        return mask,comp,seq\n\nfor h,w in [(4,4),(4,5),(5,5),(5,6),(6,6)]:\n    cnt=0\n    for _ in range(1000):\n        a,b,seq=gen(h,w)\n        if conn(a,True,True) and conn(b,True,True) and bbox_full(a,True) and bbox_full(b,True):\n            cnt+=1\n        else:\n            print('bad', (h,w), ''.join(seq))\n            for row in a: print(''.join('#' if x else '.' for x in row))\n            print('comp')\n            for row in b: print(''.join('#' if x else '.' for x in row))\n            raise SystemExit\n    print((h,w), cnt)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
